Book of Stabbing is an [[Elite]] enemy found exclusively in [[Act 2]].

== Pattern ==
{{Intents|Book of Stabbing}}

15% chance to use {{Int|Book of Stabbing|Big Stab}} and an 85% chance to use {{Int|Book of Stabbing|Multi Stab}}.

Cannot use {{Int|Book of Stabbing|Multi Stab}} 3 times in a row and cannot use {{Int|Book of Stabbing|Big Stab}} twice in a row.

== Found With ==

=== Act 2 ===
* Solo

== Trivia ==
* Book of Stabbing appears in the artwork of {{C|Safety}}.
* While this enemy does not return in the sequel, the {{BD|Painful Stabs}} effect is reused for the Act 3 boss {{M2|Test Subject}}'s second phase.

